 "notes": "Episode 8 pack atlas, merged into enemies_battle. Base frame <id> facing RIGHT, origin bottom-centre (the default; the `origin` table agrees). Derived <id>_idle_1, _attack, _hurt, _die_0..2 for every id, _cast for margin_imp, paper_crane, catalog_wraith, inkbound_librarian, unnamed_sentry(_cracked), struck_page, truth_grief, truth_change; anims <id>_idle and <id>_die. Draw 1x, untinted. index_hound, margin_imp, paper_crane, gnawing_bookworm, catalog_wraith, inkbound_librarian (enemies.png cells 2, 0, 6, 3, 1, 5, recoloured ink black, violet, cream paper and gold), unnamed_sentry (cell 5, gilt over ink, a blank faceplate) and unnamed_sentry_cracked (its 50% look: the faceplate cracked), struck_page, truth_grief, truth_change (drawn in code; Grief and Change stand on their own ground shadow). Every foe carries a dark outline and a gold rim. `rows`: for the foes whose HUD row sits under their feet, `feet` [dx, dy] from the origin (the origin itself) and `bodyPx` [x0, x1, y0, y1] of the opaque body from the origin, for the row-placement test (CRITIQUE_8 item 1: rows at least 12 internal px from any party sprite). The Eraser lives in bosses_battle (see `external`)."
